      <description align="center" color="transparent" colored="true" height="103" resized="false" width="180" x="466" y="344">I/P 1: ccp tags&lt;br&gt;I/P 2: Current data&lt;br&gt;I/P 3: model_alert&lt;br&gt;I/P 4: ccp_info&lt;br&gt;5. switch_configuration</description>
      <description align="center" color="transparent" colored="true" height="122" resized="false" width="180" x="869" y="315">Check model skip check and parameter nan check&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br&gt;O/P 1: Current data&lt;br&gt;O/P 2: Model status&lt;br&gt;</description>
      <description align="center" color="orange" colored="true" height="661" resized="true" width="364" x="18" y="16">Data validation model skip check&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Author:&lt;br&gt;Akshay Hasabe&lt;br&gt;Naveen Kumar&lt;br&gt;Karthik Sanagapalli&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Overview:&lt;br&gt;This process determines the model status by checking plant operation status and verifying required parameters for the optimizer. It filters out &amp;quot;skip&amp;quot; entries, checks plant status, identifies missing parameters, updates status alerts&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Inputs:&lt;br&gt;1: ccp tags&lt;br&gt;2: Current data&lt;br&gt;3: model_alert&lt;br&gt;4: ccp_info&lt;br&gt;5. switch_configuration&lt;br/&gt;Input_macros:&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;1.end_time&lt;br/&gt;2. model_id&lt;br/&gt;3. endtime_count&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Output:&lt;br&gt;1.Current data&lt;br&gt;2. model_status</description>
    </process>
  </operator>
</process>
